        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2381] If the EVCC offers and the public SECC chooses a named group and signature algorithm based on curves as defined by [V2G20-2319] (as per the configurable mechanism as defined by [V2G20-2320]), the SECC certificate chain provided by the public SECC in the \"ServerHello\" message shall be based on profiles as defined in B.4.2.",
